  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/574642/diamond-spheres-erudition-esoterica\">Diamond Spheres: Erudition &amp; Esoterica</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Craft (alchemy) 10 ranks, Alchemy sphere ((toxin) package).<br>\n<strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you create a mutagen that gives a choice between multiple options, you can choose two such options—for example, a Performance Enhancer could grant its benefits to both Strength and Dexterity, as well as its associated penalties.</p>\n<p>If such a mutagen would only apply to a single instance of a roll (such as Psychotropic Hallucinogen), the mutagen applies to both chosen instances of the roll—for example, a Psychotropic Hallucinogen would apply to the next check made with an Intelligence-based skill check, as well as to the next check made with a Wisdom-based skill check.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/practitioner-feats#toc20\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
